{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "皆さんこにちは株式会社さくら作プラス代表の中山", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660343.1352324}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。本日は2026年7月期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660348.0244813}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "第3四半期決算についてご案内申し上げます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660349.437832}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は二千二十六年七月期第三四半期", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660354.4033766}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "決算概要についてお知らせいたします。売上高については百", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660358.2151196}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "三十六億七千九百万となり、前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660362.8440292}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "比五点四パーセントの減収となりました。これは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660366.2497647}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "既存円の在籍率向上や工程価格の上昇による", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660370.2648606}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金増額、保育所の新規開設や増床が寄与し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660374.508378}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主力の保育サービスにおて増収となりました", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660379.4108043}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不動産事業は前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660382.813219}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "大型不動産売却案件の反動により", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660387.2676144}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "当期も不動産売却は実施したものの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660390.2815015}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "全体としては減収となりました。なお", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660393.2752447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "その他サービスは概ね計画通り進捗してります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660396.395221}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は十億六千百万円となり前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660400.1317053}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一点五パーセントの減益となりました。しかし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660404.5870464}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の撤退や中核事業の合理化", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660408.3105721}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "業務効率化により営業利益率は七点五パーセントから七点八", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660411.4997754}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "パーセントに向上しました。経常利益は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660415.9314656}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一億二千八百万円となり前年同期比", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660419.287231}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "九点五パーセントの増益となりました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660422.303445}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育所の新規開設や蔵書の実施によりこれらに伴う", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660425.3253167}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "開園前の補助金収入が加算されたことにより増益となりまし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660429.3037913}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660433.146282}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "八億三千四百万となり、前年同期比十四点六パーセントの増益", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660437.0150583}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "となりました前期に計上した", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660441.9801116}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "再三事業の撤退に伴う特別損失がなくなったため、同期は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660445.0092862}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "増益となりました。続いて進捗率についてお知らせいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660449.329162}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "売上高は通期予算に対して76。8の進捗率となります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660454.2851305}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "各サービス等も堅調に成長しており", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660459.2444444}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "投資反機累計機関におて順調に推移しておます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660462.668091}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "営業利益は通期予算に対し", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660464.453243}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "対応のない成果や", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660469.434088}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "不採算事業の定義といった毎期継続している費用削減の資格が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660473.6081192}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "確実に低下を創出し、収益が", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660478.1418233}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "概ね予算通りに推移する中でこれらの施策が利益の上振れを", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660481.5012631}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "けん引し、当四半期累計期間において", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660486.0258865}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "通期予算を前倒しして達成しました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660488.7261071}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて貸借対照表です", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660492.2890053}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "資産の後は販売に伴う販売用不動産の減少があった", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660496.903887}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "補助金収入による未収入金の増加不動産取得", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660501.8915896}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "保育施設の陳説増床に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660504.5445225}
