{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "主に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660513.750859}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "増床に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660515.822111}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "産", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660521.0004585}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "負債合計は二十一億三千三百万", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660525.4272869}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。これらの結果、自己資本比率は43。9から", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660530.4090428}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "40。7に低下いたしました。続いて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660535.273629}
