{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "他人口増加で保育所が不足している晴海エリアから月島エリア", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660555.5518284}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "で、親子で乗れる送迎バスの運行も開始しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660559.8294854}
