{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "東京都中央区にて一施設の新居保育所の開設を予定しております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660567.8465993}
