{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "連結子会社のイェールにて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660575.7821708}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "年夏頃に新製品の発売を予定しておます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660578.8298552}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この新製品の発売により量産サプリメント市場で", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660581.900021}
