{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "続いて覚悟会社の取締役の就任についてお知らせいたします", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660589.7067637}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "連結子会社の桜咲く未来で石川祐介氏が取締役へ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660594.6710975}
