{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.24.2-20260710-141211-28394ffa", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "。なお石川氏は桜作プラス経営管理本部長も兼任しておます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783660600.3202524}
